1578
01:04:04.580 --> 01:04:07.860
Can they not just get the nutrients they need?

1579
01:04:08.000 --> 01:04:09.500
Also, why is everything beige?

1580
01:04:09.720 --> 01:04:11.100
They have dye for the pills.

1581
01:04:11.360 --> 01:04:13.120
Can't you have, like, a blue blouse?

1582
01:04:13.580 --> 01:04:15.160
So you're back on the clothes.

1583
01:04:15.340 --> 01:04:15.580
Sorry.

1584
01:04:15.700 --> 01:04:18.560
I'm like, why does the food look like vomit?

1585
01:04:18.740 --> 01:04:19.420
I don't know.

1586
01:04:19.740 --> 01:04:23.420
Well, Morpheus is going to say it's time to bring Neo to meet the Oracle.

1587
