Here's the thing I was surprised about.

1588
01:04:25.500 --> 01:04:25.720
What?

1589
01:04:25.720 --> 01:04:27.660
The entire crew goes.

1590
01:04:28.060 --> 01:04:30.180
Everyone goes, except for Tank and Dozer.

1591
01:04:30.480 --> 01:04:30.800
Everyone.

1592
01:04:30.800 --> 01:04:31.720
Well, I think backup.

1593
01:04:32.120 --> 01:04:35.860
I mean, that shot of all of them, like, in that room.

1594
01:04:35.880 --> 01:04:36.320
It's cool.

1595
01:04:36.420 --> 01:04:37.140
It's very cool.

1596
01:04:37.260 --> 01:04:39.840
It is such a beautiful tableau.

1597
01:04:39.900 --> 01:04:40.740
It really is.

1598
01:04:40.820 --> 01:04:44.220
And they're all in their, like, cool, slick outfits.

1599
01:04:44.640 --> 01:04:45.700
Their kick-ass outfits.

1600
01:04:45.900 --> 01:04:46.060
Yep.

1601
01:04:46.380 --> 01:04:51.560
As everyone sort of leaves the hotel building that they've arrived in,

1602
01:04:51.560 --> 01:04:55.360
and Cypher tosses his phone, his, like, cell phone, into a trash can.

1603
01:04:55.500 --> 01:04:57.880
And he, like, has made an outgoing call.

1604
01:04:57.900 --> 01:04:58.880
So it's, like, active.

1605
01:04:59.220 --> 01:04:59.480
Yeah.

1606
01:04:59.560 --> 01:05:01.600
I guess that's how they're going to trace them.

1607
01:05:01.720 --> 01:05:01.920
Yeah.

1608
01:05:02.340 --> 01:05:03.800
Morpheus and Neo, they're there.

1609
01:05:03.900 --> 01:05:06.780
They're standing at the door where the Oracle lives.

1610
01:05:07.000 --> 01:05:08.740
I loved everything about the scene.

1611
01:05:08.900 --> 01:05:10.180
I loved her so much.

1612
01:05:10.320 --> 01:05:11.040
Well, of course.

1613
01:05:11.040 --> 01:05:11.820
We'll get to it.

1614
01:05:12.160 --> 01:05:12.560
Yes.

1615
01:05:12.820 --> 01:05:15.940
So Morpheus says, Neo, you have to enter the door.

1616
01:05:16.260 --> 01:05:16.960
I can't.

1617
01:05:17.040 --> 01:05:19.660
I can take you to the door, but I can't walk you through it.

1618
01:05:19.760 --> 01:05:20.160
Yes.

1619
