She takes him to kind of a waiting room of other potential the ones.

1621
01:05:30.260 --> 01:05:33.480
There's a lot of children with very special powers.

1622
01:05:33.700 --> 01:05:40.160
Which makes sense because Morpheus has told us they usually don't take a mind so late in life.

1623
01:05:40.580 --> 01:05:41.060
Yes.

1624
01:05:41.280 --> 01:05:41.460
Right?

1625
01:05:41.940 --> 01:05:45.280
Well, I think that children's minds are more open.

1626
01:05:45.460 --> 01:05:47.800
So Neo's going to have a conversation with one of these kids.

1627
01:05:47.800 --> 01:05:50.940
It's this kid has a spoon and he's like bending it with his mind.

1628
01:05:51.360 --> 01:05:54.600
And he's going to offer the spoon to Neo and say, why don't you bend it?

1629
01:05:54.800 --> 01:05:55.120
Mm-hmm.

1630
01:05:55.480 --> 01:05:56.680
I think we should hear it.

1631
01:05:56.680 --> 01:05:59.340
Do not try and bend the spoon.

1632
01:06:00.160 --> 01:06:01.600
That's impossible.

1633
