Instead, only try to realize the truth.

1634
01:06:07.580 --> 01:06:08.420
What truth?

1635
01:06:09.160 --> 01:06:10.720
There is no spoon.

1636
01:06:13.480 --> 01:06:14.700
There is no spoon?

1637
01:06:15.040 --> 01:06:18.400
Then you'll see that it is not the spoon that bends.

1638
01:06:18.560 --> 01:06:19.660
It is only yourself.

1639
01:06:19.660 --> 01:06:26.500
Well, this is so profound.

1640
01:06:26.820 --> 01:06:28.680
The truth is there is no spoon.

1641
01:06:29.100 --> 01:06:29.480
Mm-hmm.

1642
01:06:29.700 --> 01:06:32.960
Just like you're not breathing this air, none of this exists.

1643
01:06:33.760 --> 01:06:34.180
All right.

1644
01:06:34.480 --> 01:06:36.980
Neo's going to meet the Oracle, Gloria Foster.

1645
01:06:37.220 --> 01:06:38.700
Shout out to Gloria Foster.

1646
01:06:38.940 --> 01:06:42.120
She plays the Oracle in this Matrix and she is amazing.

1647
01:06:42.560 --> 01:06:43.040
Amazing.

1648
