I have my favorite line from her.

1649
01:06:45.820 --> 01:06:46.840
Oh, what is it?

1650
01:06:47.660 --> 01:06:49.020
You're cuter than I thought.

1651
01:06:49.240 --> 01:06:50.660
I can see why she likes you.

1652
01:06:51.320 --> 01:06:52.120
Neo says, who?

1653
01:06:52.480 --> 01:06:54.820
And then she says, not too bright though.

1654
01:06:55.320 --> 01:06:55.920
I know.

1655
01:06:56.000 --> 01:06:56.740
I love that.

1656
01:06:58.860 --> 01:07:03.560
So she's making some cookies when he walks in.

1657
01:07:03.740 --> 01:07:06.680
It's so like homey and like grandma-like.

1658
01:07:06.920 --> 01:07:08.680
She says, I know why you're here.

1659
01:07:08.760 --> 01:07:09.900
You want to know if you're the one.

1660
01:07:10.260 --> 01:07:10.500
Yeah.

1661
01:07:10.760 --> 01:07:16.300
And then she says, you know, being the one is kind of like being in love.

1662
01:07:16.840 --> 01:07:17.860
No one can tell you.

1663
01:07:17.980 --> 01:07:18.860
You just know it.

1664
01:07:19.500 --> 01:07:23.700
But lady, I grabbed an audio clip because I want to hear Gloria Foster say it.

1665
01:07:23.940 --> 01:07:24.080
Okay.

1666
01:07:24.640 --> 01:07:26.340
I'm going to let you in on a little secret.

1667
01:07:26.820 --> 01:07:29.860
Being the one is just like being in love.

1668
01:07:31.220 --> 01:07:32.960
No one can tell you you're in love.

1669
01:07:33.060 --> 01:07:33.940
You just know it.

1670
01:07:34.360 --> 01:07:35.220
Through and through.

1671
01:07:37.060 --> 01:07:37.860
Balls to bones.

1672
01:07:40.120 --> 01:07:40.960
Balls to bones.

1673
01:07:41.000 --> 01:07:41.460
Mm-hmm.

1674
01:07:41.860 --> 01:07:42.240
Mm-hmm.

1675
01:07:42.340 --> 01:07:46.720
She sort of kind of goes through the motions of looking at his hands and his face like none

1676
01:07:46.720 --> 01:07:48.380
of this stuff she needs to do, right?

1677
01:07:48.560 --> 01:07:48.800
Yeah.

1678
01:07:48.800 --> 01:07:52.280
And she says, look, you've got the gift, but you're not the one.

1679
01:07:52.440 --> 01:07:53.900
Maybe in your next life.

1680
01:07:54.020 --> 01:07:59.400
But she does say that Morpheus is going to sacrifice his own life to save Neo's because

1681
