Morpheus so fully believes that Neo is the one.

1682
01:08:03.140 --> 01:08:07.100
And Neo will have to choose between his life and Morpheus's life.

1683
01:08:07.320 --> 01:08:07.620
Yes.

1684
01:08:07.740 --> 01:08:09.240
But one of them will die.

1685
01:08:09.440 --> 01:08:11.440
And she said, look, you've got a good heart.

1686
01:08:11.440 --> 01:08:13.960
And I hate giving bad news to good people.

1687
01:08:14.620 --> 01:08:16.600
But just, you know, eat your cookie.

1688
01:08:16.800 --> 01:08:19.440
And as soon as you get outside, you're going to feel right as rain.

1689
01:08:19.920 --> 01:08:23.160
Every time I watch this movie, those cookies look so good to me.

1690
01:08:23.320 --> 01:08:25.900
They look like an oatmeal chocolate chip cookie.

1691
01:08:26.100 --> 01:08:27.580
Is that why you brought cookies today?

1692
01:08:27.780 --> 01:08:28.700
Oh, my God.

1693
01:08:28.700 --> 01:08:29.560
I thought about that.

1694
01:08:29.560 --> 01:08:30.360
I brought cookies today.

1695
01:08:30.600 --> 01:08:30.960
I know.

1696
01:08:31.200 --> 01:08:32.700
You normally don't bring cookies.

1697
01:08:33.000 --> 01:08:34.260
I made cookies.

1698
01:08:34.260 --> 01:08:35.140
Wow.

1699
01:08:35.500 --> 01:08:36.600
Was that subconscious?

1700
01:08:36.880 --> 01:08:38.100
It must have been.

1701
01:08:38.360 --> 01:08:42.040
Because the cookies looked so good in the movie when I watched it.

1702
01:08:42.160 --> 01:08:45.480
We also did not plan this or discuss this, but we both wore black.

1703
01:08:46.660 --> 01:08:47.840
That's so funny.

1704
01:08:48.280 --> 01:08:49.320
Oh, my goodness.

1705
01:08:50.480 --> 01:08:52.360
Neo walks out into the hallway.

1706
01:08:52.580 --> 01:08:53.480
Morpheus is there.

1707
01:08:53.660 --> 01:08:54.480
And Neo says, listen.

1708
