Oh, really?

1737
01:09:50.620 --> 01:09:50.820
Mm-hmm.

1738
01:09:51.080 --> 01:09:54.140
My old group that we, like, hang out sometimes, my improv crowd.

1739
01:09:54.360 --> 01:09:54.520
Mm-hmm.

1740
01:09:54.880 --> 01:09:55.760
Glitch in the matrix.

1741
01:09:56.100 --> 01:09:56.800
Do you say that?

1742
01:09:57.300 --> 01:09:57.460
I don't.

1743
01:09:58.460 --> 01:10:00.740
I don't even think I say deja vu very much either.

1744
01:10:00.740 --> 01:10:01.840
I sometimes say deja vu.

