And Morpheus is determined to protect his team.

1764
01:10:45.700 --> 01:10:51.940
So he throws himself through this hole in the wall on top of one of the agents and begins

1765
01:10:51.940 --> 01:10:52.660
to fight him.

1766
01:10:53.040 --> 01:10:53.220
Yeah.

1767
01:10:53.680 --> 01:10:57.720
In the midst of all this chaos, Cypher has gotten out and called Tank and said, I need

1768
01:10:57.720 --> 01:10:58.200
to come in.

